            <ArticleTitle>[How to choose and deliver orthodontic mini-screws: important notions].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>295-302</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1051/orthodfr/2015027</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Orthodontic mini-screws are developing more and more because they make orthodontics easier and broaden its applications. This exponential development has arrived at a well defined mini-screw and a codified installation procedure. The aim of this article is to provide the conceptual elements of mini-screws in order to allow their safe use in orthodontic offices.</AbstractText>
